sequenceDiagram
    actor T as Traveler
    participant B as Browser
    participant C as ItineraryItemController
    participant IT as Itinerary (Model)
    participant DB as MySQL

    T->>B: Pilih itinerary, hari, jam, submit
    B->>C: POST /itinerary/{id}/item
    C->>C: authorizeOwner(itinerary)
    C->>C: validate(destination_id, day_number, ...)
    C->>IT: items()->create([...])
    IT->>DB: INSERT INTO itinerary_items
    DB-->>IT: baris tersimpan
    IT-->>C: ItineraryItem
    C-->>B: redirect back + flash status
    B-->>T: Tampilkan destinasi baru di builder
